          "text": "The pattern indexes as a face-centered cubic cell with \\(a \\approx 10.500\\) \u00c5. The observed 200 reflection at \\(2\\theta\\approx16.88^\\circ\\) excludes the centrosymmetric spinel parent \\(Fd\\bar3m\\). The composition and reflection intensities support an ordered lacunar-spinel structure in \\(F\\bar43m\\) (No. 216), with \\(Z=4\\).\n\nRepresentative indexing: 111 at 14.60\u00b0, 200 at 16.88\u00b0, 220 at 23.95\u00b0, 311 at 28.16\u00b0, 222 at 29.45\u00b0, 400 at 34.13\u00b0, and 440 at 49.04\u00b0.\n\n### Primary CIF\n\n```cif\ndata_CuZr4S8\n_audit_creation_method             'Powder XRD indexing and intensity-based lacunar-spinel model'\n_chemical_name_common              'copper tetrazirconium octasulfide'\n_chemical_formula_structural       'CuZr4S8'\n_chemical_formula_sum              'Cu Zr4 S8'\n_cell_formula_units_Z              4\n\n_cell_length_a                     10.5000\n_cell_length_b                     10.5000\n_cell_length_c                     10.5000\n_cell_angle_alpha                  90\n_cell_angle_beta                   90\n_cell_angle_gamma                  90\n_cell_volume                       1157.625\n_exptl_crystal_density_diffrn      3.930\n\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt          'F -4 3 m'\n_space_group_IT_number             216\n_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M     'F -4 3 m'\n_symmetry_Int_Tables_number        216\n\n_diffrn_radiation_type             'Cu Kalpha1'\n_diffrn_radiation_wavelength       1.5406\n\nloop_\n_atom_type_symbol\n_atom_type_oxidation_number\nCu  1\nZr  3.75\nS  -2\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_Wyckoff_symbol\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_site_fract_z\n_atom_site_occupancy\n_atom_site_B_iso_or_equiv\nCu1 Cu  4  a  0.0000  0.0000  0.0000  1.0  0.50\nZr1 Zr 16  e  0.3775  0.3775  0.3775  1.0  0.50\nS1  S  16  e  0.1340  0.1340  0.1340  1.0  0.50\nS2  S  16  e  0.6160  0.6160  0.6160  1.0  0.50\n```\n\nThe